---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+17725550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(772) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Air Quality Testing in Fort Pierce, FL | Fort Pierce Mold Specialists" description="Indoor air quality and mold spore testing in Fort Pierce, FL. Lab-analyzed samples and clear reporting.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Air Quality Testing in Fort Pierce</h1>
      <p>Indoor air quality and mold spore testing in Fort Pierce, FL. Lab-analyzed samples and clear reporting.</p>
      <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top:1.25rem">Call </a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:800px">
<h2>Know What You Are Breathing</h2>
<p>Air sampling compares indoor spore levels to outdoor baselines and helps document conditions before or after remediation. Results come from an accredited laboratory.</p>
<ul>
<li>Indoor and outdoor air samples</li>
<li>Surface sampling when useful</li>
<li>Professional lab analysis</li>
<li>Easy-to-understand report</li>
</ul>
<p>Testing is a tool — we help you interpret results and decide on next steps for your Fort Pierce property.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:2rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call Now — </a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
